    "heading": "Why not just use ChatGPT? We tested chat assistants on real Records",
    "lede": "We gave general-purpose chat assistants the same notes and photos as Quickler on real Records. On 14 Records, Quickler filled 87% of answers the way customers kept them and a plain chat 57 to 63%. On 24 Records, a custom chat set up from the firm's own form and a paragraph of house rules filled about half (50 to 51%); Quickler filled 86%. Tested on 24 and 25 November 2026.",
